                <th style="font-family:Arial Unicode MS ;font-size: 8pt; color: #88898b; margin-bottom:0px;padding-bottom:0px;border: 1px solid #bcbec0;" width="50%" height="15" valign="middle"><strong>« Producten »</strong></th>
                <th style="font-family:Arial Unicode MS ;font-size: 5pt; color: #88898b; margin-bottom:0px;padding-bottom:0px;border: 1px solid #bcbec0;" width="50%" height="8" valign="middle">De diensten en/of goederen die door de Handelaar aan consumenten/Gebruikers te koop worden aangeboden.</th>    
